```lean
theorem antitoneOn_ratio_le_one_of_tendsto_nhdsGT_one {R : ℝ} (hR : 0 < R) {f : ℝ → ℝ}
    (hanti : AntitoneOn f (Set.Ioo 0 R)) (hlim : Tendsto f (𝓝[>] 0) (𝓝 1)) {r : ℝ}
    (hr : r ∈ Set.Ioo 0 R) : f r ≤ 1 := by
  by_contra hnot
  have hgt : 1 < f r := lt_of_not_ge hnot
  have hpos : 0 < (f r - 1) / 2 := half_pos (sub_pos.mpr hgt)
  obtain ⟨δ, hδ, hclose⟩ := (Metric.tendsto_nhdsWithin_nhds.mp hlim) hpos
  -- hclose : ∀ x ∈ Set.Ioi 0, dist x 0 < δ → dist (f x) 1 < (f r - 1) / 2
  let s : ℝ := (min δ r) / 2
  have hs0 : 0 < s := half_pos (lt_min hδ hr.1)
  have hsr : s < r := by
    have : min δ r ≤ r := min_le_right _ _
    exact lt_of_lt_of_le (half_lt_self (lt_min hδ hr.1)) this
  have hsδ : s < δ := by
    have : min δ r ≤ δ := min_le_left _ _
    exact lt_of_lt_of_le (half_lt_self (lt_min hδ hr.1)) this
  have hsI : s ∈ Set.Ioi 0 := hs0
  have hclose_s := hclose s hsI (by simpa [Real.dist_eq, abs_of_pos hs0] using hsδ)
  -- dist (f s) 1 < (f r - 1) / 2
  have hfs : f s < f r := by
    have hd : |f s - 1| < (f r - 1) / 2 := by simpa [Real.dist_eq] using hclose_s
    have hle1 : f s - 1 ≤ |f s - 1| := le_abs_self _
    linarith
  have hant := hanti hsI (by exact Set.mem_Ioo.mpr ⟨hs0, lt_trans hsr hr.2⟩) (Set.mem_Ioo.mpr hr) (le_of_lt hsr)
  exact (not_lt_of_ge hant) hfs
```
Wait — `hanti` : AntitoneOn f (Ioo 0 R) — signature: `AntitoneOn f s : ∀ ⦃a⦄, a ∈ s → ∀ ⦃b⦄, b ∈ s → a ≤ b → f b ≤ f a`. So `hanti (a-mem) (b-mem) (h : a ≤ b) : f b ≤ f a`. With a = s, b = r: hanti hsI... careful about argument order: `hanti hsI hr hsr' : f r ≤ f s`. Then `not_lt_of_ge (f r ≤ f s)` vs `f s < f r` ✓.

`hant` : f r ≤ f s; hfs : f s < f r → contradiction: `exact (not_lt_of_ge hant) hfs` — not_lt_of_ge : a ≤ b → ¬ b < a — so ¬(f s < f r) — contradiction with hfs. ✓

`hsr' : s ≤ r` = le_of_lt hsr ✓.

The `min δ r` — δ : ℝ from the exists. `half_lt_self (lt_min hδ hr.1)` : (min δ r)/2 < min δ r given 0 < min δ r — half_lt_self needs h : 0 < a. `lt_min hδ hr.1 : 0 < min δ r` ✓. `min_le_right : min a b ≤ b`, `min_le_left : min a b ≤ a` ✓.

`Metric.tendsto_nhdsWithin_nhds.mp hlim : ∀ ε > 0, ∃ δ > 0, ∀ x ∈ Set.Ioi 0, dist x 0 < δ → dist (f x) 1 < ε` ✓ — with s := Ioi 0 since 𝓝[>] 0 = 𝓝[Ioi 0] 0 ✓.

`obtain ⟨δ, hδ, hclose⟩ := (... ) hpos` ✓.

